    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Likungu lya Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likungu kwa Aliyele, Aliyele, msinda wele Daudi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵataŵileko yisakasa ga ngondo. Cili cipitile caka cimo kapena yiŵili, masiku gosope ga yindimba gali gapitilile nditu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu taciputa ngondo ni msinda wa Aliyele. Myoyo tipaciŵa kulila ni kudandawula, nipo msindawo tiwucitendekwa kuŵa mpela ufuni wa pa malo gakupelecela mbopesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu tacitaŵa kweleko yisakasa ya ngondo yakulimbana ni msindawo, taciwusyungulila ni sanja sya ngondo ni kutaŵa malo gakuputila ngondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano ali amgwisisye pasi, m'mweji Yelusalemu timciŵeceta maloŵe, gele tigacipikanika mli luwundu. Liloŵe lyenu tilicipikanika kutyocela pasi mpela lya cilengwalengwa, maloŵe genu tigacipikanika mpela gakutyocela mu luwundu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo amagongo ŵenu ŵajinji tacitendekwa kuŵa mpela luwundu lwamnono, amagongo ŵenu ŵajinji tacipwilingana mpela matimba gaguluka. Nipo ndaŵi jijojo soni mwacisisimucisya ni mwangajembecela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Ŵamaciligosope tacimkulupusya ni kulindima, kutenganyika kwa cilambo ni lisegwe lyekulungwa. Tacitumisya soni cimbunga, mbungo jamacili ni malamba ga moto wakonanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " josope mitundu jakumenyana ni msinda wa Aliyele, wosope ŵakulimbana ni msindawo nipo soni lipupa lyakwe lyakulimba ni kuwusyungulila, wosopewo tacisimilila mpela sagamisi, mpela yindu yakuyiwona cilo m'mesomkulola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likuga lya ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine josope ja ŵandu ŵakuputa ngondo ni Litumbi lya Siyoni",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " tiliciŵa mpela mundu jwa sala jwakusasagamila ali mkulya, nambo pakwimuka, ali ciŵela jwa sala, kapena tiliciŵa soni mpela mundu jwa njota jwakusasagamila alimkumwa, nambo pakwimuka, kungulo kuli kwejumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ungapikanila yiŵalekasisye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtojime ni mŵe ŵakusimonga. Mlitendesyepe kuŵa ŵatatale ni mŵe ciŵela ŵangalola. Mkolelwe nambo ngaŵaga ni finyo ni mpepeluce, nambo ngaŵaga ni cakumwa ukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE amgonesye lugono lwa kuwa nalo. Amwugele meso, jemanja ŵakulocesya, amsiŵile kumtwe, jemanja ŵakusagamukula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.11.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alo 11:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa jemanja yindu yiliyose yakuyiwona m'mesomkulola yiŵele yakusisika mpela maloŵe ga m'buku jemate. Buku jelejo ali ampele jwine jwakombola kuŵalanga kuti aŵalanje, jwalakwe taciti, “Une nginipakombola ligongo jili jemate.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naga bukujo mkumpa jwine jwangamanyilila kuŵalanga, jwalakwe taciti, “Une jwangamanyilila kuŵalanga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵaŵecete ni une acitiji kuti, “Ŵandu ŵeleŵa akusati akusapopela kwa une, nambo maloŵe gawo gali gangali mate, nipo mitima jawo jili kutali ni Une. Kulambila kwa jemanja kuli kwagamba kugakuya cabe malamusi ga cikumbukumbu ca pa mtima, malamusi gakutyocela kwa ŵandu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.15.8+MAT.15.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 15:8-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.7.6+MRK.7.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mak 7:6-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ligongo lyakwe une tinjipitilisya kwatendela yakusimonjesya ŵandu ŵelewo. Lunda lwa ŵandu ŵawo ŵalunda tulucimala, nipo kalamuka kwa ŵandu ŵawo ŵakalamuka tukucisimilila.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.1.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Akoli 1:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cembeceyo ca ya msogolo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likungu kwa ŵele ŵakusasisa nganisyo syawo kwasisila AMBUJE, ŵakusatenda masengo gawo mcipi, alimkuganisya kuti pangali jwine jwali mkwalola soni kuyimanyilila yakutenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yindu yosope myisokonesye. Ana cakupunda cili cici, jwagumba yiŵiga kapena litaka lyakugumbila yiŵigayo? Ana cindu cakupanganyidwa komboleka kumsalila mundu jwakucipanganya kuti, “Nganimumbanganya m'mwejo?” Ana komboleka kumsalila kuti, “Ngimkumanyilila cimkutenda?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.45.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 45:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pajatu pitijipite ndaŵi jamnono, ukweti wa ku Lebanoni tiwucitendekwa kuŵa mgunda wa cajila, nipo mgunda wa cajila tucitendekwa kuŵa ukweti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa lisiku lyelelo ŵandu ŵangapikana tacipikana maloŵe kutyocela m'buku, nipo ŵandu ŵangalola uŵatamaga mcipi, taciwugula meso gawo ni kulola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵakulinandiya tacipata soni lukondwa mwa AMBUJE, nipo ŵandu ŵa usawuci tacisengwa ligongo lya Ŵaswela wa Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
